---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pagination:
  data: agriculturalNewsMerged.countries
  size: 1
  alias: country
permalink: "/agricultural-news/{{ country.slug }}/"
language: en
pageLanguage: en
---
<div id="goa-language-targets"
 data-url-en="/agricultural-news/{{ country.slug }}/"
 data-url-fr="/fr/agricultural-news/{{ country.slug }}/"
 data-url-ar="/ar/agricultural-news/{{ country.slug }}/"
 data-url-pt="/pt/agricultural-news/{{ country.slug }}/"
 data-url-sw="/sw/agricultural-news/{{ country.slug }}/"></div><section class="section" style="padding-top:48px;">
<div class="container">
{% set displayCountryName = country.localizedNames[pageLanguage] if country.localizedNames and pageLanguage != "en" else country.name %}
{% if pageLanguage == "ar" %}
<p><a href="/ar/agricultural-news/">→ جميع الأخبار الزراعية</a></p>
{% elif pageLanguage == "fr" %}
<p><a href="/fr/agricultural-news/">← Toutes les actualités agricoles</a></p>
{% elif pageLanguage == "pt" %}
<p><a href="/pt/agricultural-news/">← Todas as notícias agrícolas</a></p>
{% elif pageLanguage == "sw" %}
<p><a href="/sw/agricultural-news/">← Habari zote za kilimo</a></p>
{% else %}
<p><a href="/agricultural-news/">← All Agricultural News</a></p>
{% endif %}
{% if pageLanguage == "ar" %}
<h1>{{ country.flag }} الأخبار الزراعية — {{ displayCountryName }}</h1>
<p class="lede">آخر التطورات الزراعية الموثقة لهذا البلد.</p>
{% elif pageLanguage == "fr" %}
<h1>{{ country.flag }} Actualités agricoles — {{ displayCountryName }}</h1>
<p class="lede">Les dernières actualités agricoles vérifiées de ce pays.</p>
{% elif pageLanguage == "pt" %}
<h1>{{ country.flag }} Notícias agrícolas — {{ displayCountryName }}</h1>
<p class="lede">Atualizações agrícolas verificadas mais recentes deste país.</p>
{% elif pageLanguage == "sw" %}
<h1>{{ country.flag }} Habari za kilimo — {{ displayCountryName }}</h1>
<p class="lede">Habari za hivi karibuni za kilimo zilizothibitishwa kwa nchi hii.</p>
{% else %}
<h1>{{ country.flag }} Agricultural News — {{ displayCountryName }}</h1>
<p class="lede">Current, verified agricultural developments for this country.</p>
{% endif %}
{% set publishedArticles = [] %}
{% for candidate in country.articles %}
  {% if (candidate.status == "official" or candidate.status == "published" or candidate.status == "verified") and (not candidate.lifecycle or candidate.lifecycle == "current") %}{% set _ = publishedArticles.push(candidate) %}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% set renderedArticles = [] %}
{% for article in publishedArticles %}
{% set activeLanguage = pageLanguage or language or "en" %}
{% set translated = article.translations[activeLanguage] if article.translations else null %}
{% if activeLanguage == "en" or (translated and translated.title and translated.summary) %}
{% set _ = renderedArticles.push(article) %}
<article class="card" style="margin:16px 0;">
<h2>{{ translated.title if translated and translated.title else article.title }}</h2>
<p>{{ translated.summary if translated and translated.summary else article.summary }}</p>
<p><small>
{% if activeLanguage == "ar" %}المصدر: {{ article.source }} · تاريخ التحقق: {{ article.verified }}
{% elif activeLanguage == "fr" %}Source : {{ article.source }} · Vérifié le : {{ article.verified }}
{% elif activeLanguage == "pt" %}Fonte: {{ article.source }} · Verificado em: {{ article.verified }}
{% elif activeLanguage == "sw" %}Chanzo: {{ article.source }} · Imethibitishwa: {{ article.verified }}
{% else %}Source: {{ article.source }} · Verified: {{ article.verified }}{% endif %}
</small></p>
<a href="{{ article.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
{% if activeLanguage == "ar" %}قراءة المصدر الأصلي ←
{% elif activeLanguage == "fr" %}Lire la source originale →
{% elif activeLanguage == "pt" %}Ler a fonte original →
{% elif activeLanguage == "sw" %}Soma chanzo asili →
{% else %}Read original source →{% endif %}
</a>
</article>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if renderedArticles.length == 0 %}
<div class="card news-empty-fallback">
{% if pageLanguage == "ar" %}
<h2>يجري التحقق من الأخبار</h2><p>لا توجد أخبار حالية موثقة منشورة بهذه اللغة لهذا البلد حتى الآن. ننشر الأخبار بعد التحقق من مصدر رسمي أو موثوق.</p><p>يمكنك استكشاف <a href="/ar/agriculture-resources/">الموارد الزراعية</a> أو <a href="/opportunities/">الفرص</a> أو <a href="/search/">البحث في معلومات الزراعة</a>.</p>
{% elif pageLanguage == "fr" %}
<h2>Actualités en cours de vérification</h2><p>Aucune actualité récente vérifiée n’est encore publiée dans cette langue pour ce pays. Nous publions uniquement après vérification d’une source officielle ou fiable.</p><p>Consultez les <a href="/fr/agriculture-resources/">ressources agricoles</a>, les <a href="/opportunities/">opportunités</a> ou <a href="/search/">recherchez des informations agricoles</a>.</p>
{% elif pageLanguage == "pt" %}
<h2>Notícias em verificação</h2><p>Ainda não há notícias recentes verificadas publicadas neste idioma para este país. Publicamos apenas após verificar uma fonte oficial ou confiável.</p><p>Explore os <a href="/pt/agriculture-resources/">recursos agrícolas</a>, as <a href="/opportunities/">oportunidades</a> ou <a href="/search/">pesquise informações agrícolas</a>.</p>
{% elif pageLanguage == "sw" %}
<h2>Habari zinathibitishwa</h2><p>Bado hakuna habari za sasa zilizothibitishwa zilizochapishwa kwa lugha hii kuhusu nchi hii. Tunachapisha baada ya kuthibitisha chanzo rasmi au cha kuaminika.</p><p>Tembelea <a href="/sw/agriculture-resources/">rasilimali za kilimo</a>, <a href="/opportunities/">fursa</a>, au <a href="/search/">tafuta taarifa za kilimo</a>.</p>
{% else %}
<h2>News is being verified</h2><p>No current verified stories have been published for this country yet. We publish only after checking an official or authoritative source.</p><p>In the meantime, explore <a href="/agriculture-resources/">agricultural resources</a>, <a href="/opportunities/">opportunities</a>, or <a href="/search/">search all farming information</a>.</p>
{% endif %}
</div>
{% endif %}
</div></section>